            "The order was signed on 29 September and reported then; what is new inside this window is the Federal Register publication, the assigned number and the authoritative text. The order creates no enforceable right, is \"subject to the availability of appropriations,\" and does not change the statutory definition — only asks for language to propose changing it. No independent reporting on the published text was opened for this item."
