        { "host": "A", "text": "Right. And across 30 model configurations from 13 developers, the strongest passes 24.7% of healthcare and 23.9% of finance attempts. The median configuration passes 0.6% and 2.5%." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "Why so far below the scores labs usually publish?" },
        { "host": "A", "text": "Because of the grading rule. Each task has an expert rubric of binary criteria, applied by an agentic judge, and an attempt passes only if it meets every single one." },
